<title>UK: Burton year profits leap 54 percent.</title>
<headline>Burton year profits leap 54 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to August 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.8		    vs 5.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.65		   up 37.5 pct</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 2.8		    vs 2.2</p>
<p> Pretax		     151.6		  vs 98.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,006.9		vs 1,878.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 139 to 149 million stg.  </p>
<p> Gross profit	     279.1		  vs 200.3</p>
<p> Exceptional		nil		    vs gain 5.5</p>
<p> Interest charge	  10.0		   vs 9.0</p>
<p> Tax			  40.9		   vs 24.6</p>
<p> Pay date		   Feb 21, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Feb 4, 1997</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
